    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29869" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐᾰρίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pass the spring</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.5.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bloom as in spring</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.99
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμῶνες ἄνθεσιν ἐαριζόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					371c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>to be like spring</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετοπώρου ἐαρίζοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.643
			</span></i>.</div>
